# ===================================================================
# AMBIPAR RESPONSE CANADA - CUSTOM RESGRID CONFIGURATION
# ===================================================================
# Version: 1.0
# Environment: Development
# Last Updated: November 2025
#
# SECURITY WARNING: This file contains sensitive credentials.
